{"id":"2517b868f96ae323","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-kleene-t-predicate.md","title":"Kleene T-predicate","display":"df-kleene-t-predicate — Kleene T-predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-kleene-t-predicate","aliases":["68-df-kleene-t-predicate"],"display":"df-kleene-t-predicate — Kleene T-predicate","depends_on":["[[68-df-program-index]]","[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]","[[68-df-sequence-code]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§8 pp.21-22 / PDF 30-31; explicit configuration-code variant","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-kleene-t-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-kleene-t-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kleene-t-predicate — Kleene T-predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"985351114b7734a0\" href=\"?note=985351114b7734a0\" title=\"68-df-program-index\">68-df-program-index</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89e092f6450e5227\" href=\"?note=89e092f6450e5227\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine-computation\">68-df-basic-machine-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§8 pp.21-22 / PDF 30-31; explicit configuration-code variant"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,k,s,q,L\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,k,s,q,L\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e,\\mathrm{Prog}\">\\(P_e,\\mathrm{Prog}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"985351114b7734a0\" href=\"?note=985351114b7734a0\" title=\"68-df-program-index\">68-df-program-index</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,\\pi_0,\\pi_1,\\mathcal R\">\\(C,\\pi_0,\\pi_1,\\mathcal R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"89e092f6450e5227\" href=\"?note=89e092f6450e5227\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine-computation\">68-df-basic-machine-computation</a> 及其上游。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sc},\\operatorname{sd},\\operatorname{cd},\\operatorname{clh},\\mathrm{Seq}\">\\(\\operatorname{sc},\\operatorname{sd},\\operatorname{cd},\\operatorname{clh},\\mathrm{Seq}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}\">\\(\\operatorname{last}\\)</span> 只在非空有限自然数序列上定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cc}_L:\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{cc}_L:\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 编码前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 个寄存器。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\">\\(T_k\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}(P):=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(P(q)=(0,i)\\lor P(q)=(1,i,n))\\},\\quad L(P,k):=1+\\max(\\{k\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Reg}(P)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Reg}(P):=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(P(q)=(0,i)\\lor P(q)=(1,i,n))\\},\\quad L(P,k):=1+\\max(\\{k\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Reg}(P)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cc}_L(q,\\rho):=\\operatorname{sc}\\bigl(\\langle q\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\rho(i):i&lt;L\\rangle\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cc}_L(q,\\rho):=\\operatorname{sc}\\bigl(\\langle q\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\rho(i):i&lt;L\\rangle\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}(a):=a(\\operatorname{lh}(a)-1)\\qquad\\bigl(a\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{()\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}(a):=a(\\operatorname{lh}(a)-1)\\qquad\\bigl(a\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{()\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_k(e,\\vec x,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}\\land s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}\\land\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(m&lt;s\\land \\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\bigl(\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\;(t&lt;m\\Longrightarrow\\pi_0(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,t))&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P_e))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\pi_0(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,m))\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e)\\\\\n&amp;\\land s=\\operatorname{sc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\operatorname{cc}_{L(P_e,k)}\\bigl(\\pi_0(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,t)),\\pi_1(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,t))\\bigr):t&lt;m+1\\right\\rangle\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_k(e,\\vec x,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}\\land s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}\\land\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(m&lt;s\\land \\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\bigl(\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\;(t&lt;m\\Longrightarrow\\pi_0(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,t))&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P_e))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\pi_0(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,m))\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e)\\\\\n&amp;\\land s=\\operatorname{sc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\operatorname{cc}_{L(P_e,k)}\\bigl(\\pi_0(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,t)),\\pi_1(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,t))\\bigr):t&lt;m+1\\right\\rangle\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T(e,x,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;T_1(e,x,s),\\qquad\nU(s):=\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{cd}(\\operatorname{last}(\\operatorname{sd}(s)),1)&amp;\\operatorname{clh}(s)&gt;0,\\\\0&amp;\\operatorname{clh}(s)=0.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T(e,x,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;T_1(e,x,s),\\qquad\nU(s):=\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{cd}(\\operatorname{last}(\\operatorname{sd}(s)),1)&amp;\\operatorname{clh}(s)&gt;0,\\\\0&amp;\\operatorname{clh}(s)=0.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §8，印刷 pp.21–22 / PDF pp.30–31。此节点直接构造有限停机记录，替换先前未核对的第 88 本导入。与原书的编码有明确实现差别：原书记录 e+k 个寄存器且由 Count 单独恢复计数器；这里用足够的寄存器宽度 L 并在每个配置中显式编码计数器。因此不声称计算编号 s 与原书逐数相同。程序编号 e 仍按本书指令及程序编码。确定性及第一次停机条件给出每个输入至多一个合法记录；末态解码第 1 分量是寄存器 0 的输出。有限记录检验可按 §8 的有界递归步骤执行，T_k 与 U 为递归的；编码变体的逐步构造已复核，未声称机器证明。</p>\n<p>新增界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&lt;s\">\\(m&lt;s\\)</span> 不排除任何原有合法记录：长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+1\">\\(m+1\\)</span> 的素数幂序列码至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{m+1}\">\\(2^{m+1}\\)</span>。第一次停机、程序合法性和输出寄存器仍沿用原条款。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-program-index","status":"resolved","id":"985351114b7734a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-program-index]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"89e092f6450e5227","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"fee56385c180d0b9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-program-index","status":"resolved","id":"985351114b7734a0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e,k,s,q,L\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$，$P\\in\\mathcal P$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R$。$P_e,\\mathrm{Prog}$ 见 [[68-df-program-index]]；$C,\\pi_0,\\pi_1,\\mathcal R$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]] 及其上游。$\\operatorname{sc},\\operatorname{sd},\\operatorname{cd},\\operatorname{clh},\\mathrm{Seq}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。$\\operatorname{last}$ 只在非空有限自然数序列上定义；$\\operatorname{cc}_L:\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N$ 编码前 $L$ 个寄存器。$T_k$ 的定义域为 $\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N^k\\ti