}_L:\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reg}(P):=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(P(q)=(0,i)\\lor P(q)=(1,i,n))\\},\\quad L(P,k):=1+\\max(\\{k\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Reg}(P)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cc}_L(q,\\rho):=\\operatorname{sc}\\bigl(\\langle q\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\rho(i):i<L\\rangle\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{last}(a):=a(\\operatorname{lh}(a)-1)\\qquad\\bigl(a\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\setminus\\{()\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T_k(e,\\vec x,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}\\land s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}\\land\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(m<s\\land \\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\bigl(\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\;(t<m\\Longrightarrow\\pi_0(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,t))<\\operatorname{lh}(P_e))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\pi_0(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,m))\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e)\\\\\n&\\land s=\\operatorname{sc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\operatorname{cc}_{L(P_e,k)}\\bigl(\\pi_0(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,t)),\\pi_1(C(P_e,k,\\vec x,t))\\bigr):t<m+1\\right\\rangle\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T(e,x,s)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;T_1(e,x,s),\\qquad\nU(s):=\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{cd}(\\operatorname{last}(\\operatorname{sd}(s)),1)&\\operatorname{clh}(s)>0,\\\\0&\\operatorname{clh}(s)=0.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"m<s","display":false},{"tex":"m+1","display":false},{"tex":"2^{m+1}","display":false}],"bytes":3325,"backlinks":[{"id":"dad7e17cfa2772ae","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e,k,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$。$T_k,U$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]，$W_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。有限元组逐分量的界用 $\\forall i<k$ 表示。"},{"id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e,k,s,r,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$。$T_k,T,U$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]；偏函数图见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$\\tau_k\\subseteq(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N^k)\\times\\mathbb N$ 是最小合法停机记录的偏函数图；$\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N$，$\\varphi_e$ 为其一元接口。下列公式均以图的成员关系表达，不对未定义的最小值求值。"},{"id":"d356be4fee142864","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k$。$\\mathrm{RE}^{(k)},W_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]，$T_k$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]，$\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"数值函数与基本机器：[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]] → [[68-df-basic-machine]] → [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]] → [[68-df-program-index]] → [[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]] → [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。"}],"outgoing":["985351114b7734a0","89e092f6450e5227","fee56385c180d0b9"]}